# Test: the built le binary runs the native development gates over the real
# accept-only: the registered native fixture enforces this scenario's behavioral contract
# checkout and exposes every verdict as command data.
#
# The native fixture compiles the cmd/ze le personality into fixture-owned
# storage. A cold build cache can make that first compile comparatively slow.

option=timeout:value=300s

cmd=foreground:seq=1:exec=ze-test fixture ui/le-dev-gates-answers
expect=exit:code=0
expect=stdout:contains=OK
